1
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,040
Mommy! What about the bomb shelter?

2
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:32,630
Mommy!

3
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:00,870
Tokyo: Present Day

4
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:00,870
Tokyo: Present Day

5
00:01:05,670 --> 00:01:07,380
Sure is peaceful...

6
00:01:11,010 --> 00:01:13,940
I live a totally normal, uneventful life.

7
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:18,380
I graduated from college, got a job 
at a major generalontracting firm,

8
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:21,840
worked my way up the ladder, 
and started making decent money.

9
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:24,230
I'm a perfectly content 37-year-old man.

10
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:30,150
If there's anything missing in my 
life right now, it's a girlfriend.

11
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:34,150
In fact, I haven't had a 
girlfriend in all my 37 years...

12
00:01:34,850 --> 00:01:38,540
But not having one doesn't 
bother me at all, really.

13
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:40,990
Senpai!

14
00:01:41,490 --> 00:01:43,860
Over here, Senpai!

15
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:47,530
Tamura, sorry I'm a bit late.

16
00:01:48,030 --> 00:01:49,430
So, what'd you want to discuss?

17
00:01:49,890 --> 00:01:52,360
Hello! I'm Sawatari Miho.

18
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:55,760
I see you around a lot, but this 
is our first time speaking.

19
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:59,410
Oh... Hi. I'm Mikami Satoru.

20
00:01:59,410 --> 00:02:01,680
I know who you are, ofourse. You're famous.

21
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,470
What?! Famous?!

22
00:02:03,930 --> 00:02:06,230
Yeah, I mean, all those rumors...

23
00:02:06,230 --> 00:02:09,020
Wh-What rumors?!

24
00:02:09,020 --> 00:02:11,920
Easy, Miho. He's just teasing you.

25
00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:14,320
Go easy on her, Senpai.

26
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:15,880
Sorry about that.

27
00:02:16,290 --> 00:02:19,820
What is this, anyway? 
Is he looking for marriage advice?

28
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:23,130
No need to stand around. 
Let's talk while we eat.

29
00:02:23,130 --> 00:02:25,190
You like yakiniku, don't you, Senpai?

30
00:02:25,190 --> 00:02:27,460
I booked a great place for us.

31
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:30,820
Jeez, he arranged one of 
my favorites for dinner?

32
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:32,460
Kid sure knows how to treat his senpai.

33
00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:34,040
It's just up ahead.

34
00:02:34,710 --> 00:02:37,720
Well, I guess I should offer 
them my congratulations.

35
00:02:45,890 --> 00:02:46,810
Tamura!

36
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:07,050
S-Senpai!

37
00:03:09,550 --> 00:03:11,870
Wh-What is this?

38
00:03:12,550 --> 00:03:13,900
It's too hot...

39
00:03:14,490 --> 00:03:16,750
I don't... want this...

40
00:03:17,870 --> 00:03:18,960
Confirmed.

41
