8364
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:32,920
Yeah, right, idiot! 
Like hell I can accept that!

8365
00:08:33,620 --> 00:08:36,240
But... I am a slime, aren't I?

8366
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:38,700
Yeah. I'm not human.

8367
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:44,170
It seems like I got stabbed, 
died, and reincarnated...

8368
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,290
as a slime.

8369
00:08:48,430 --> 00:08:51,390
I think it's been a fairly 
long time since then.

8370
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:56,820
Surprisingly, it turns out 
this body is pretty handy.

8371
00:08:56,820 --> 00:09:00,140
I don't even need to eat or sleep.

8372
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,700
So why do I eat plants, you ask?

8373
00:09:05,700 --> 00:09:07,980
Because I have nothing else to do!

8374
00:09:08,670 --> 00:09:11,980
There's no point, but I don't feel 
right if I'm not doing something.

8375
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:14,990
Wait... Who am I even talking to?

8376
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:18,980
Anyway, I wonder where 
this stuff I eat is going.

8377
00:09:18,980 --> 00:09:20,350
I haven't pooped or...

8378
00:09:21,940 --> 00:09:25,500
It is stored in the stomach
of your unique skill, Predator.

8379
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:28,910
Th-That voice... I heard 
it when I was stabbed, too!

8380
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:30,000
Wh-Who are you?

8381
00:09:30,790 --> 00:09:31,630
Answer.

8382
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:34,460
It is the effect of your 
unique skill, Great Sage.

