00:15:58,010 --> 00:15:59,060
I can see!

9879
00:15:59,060 --> 00:16:00,680
I can actually see!

9880
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:02,490
Oh, yeah!

9881
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,910
I really am a slime.

9882
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:09,910
Well?

9883
00:16:09,910 --> 00:16:10,990
Oh, right!

9884
00:16:10,990 --> 00:16:12,140
I did it!

9885
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,970
Thanks so much!

9886
00:16:16,210 --> 00:16:20,000
D-Dragon?!

9887
00:16:30,840 --> 00:16:33,760
Allow me to formally introduce myself.

9888
00:16:33,760 --> 00:16:35,640
O-Okay...

9889
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:38,590
I am the Storm Dragon, Veldora.

9890
00:16:38,590 --> 00:16:40,140
Storm Dragon?

9891
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:44,500
I am one of only four True Dragons 
that exist in this world.

9892
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,780
Hey, you do remember our promise, don't you?

9893
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:56,770
O-Of course! I'm not scared at all!

9894
00:16:56,770 --> 00:16:58,800
Well, I'll come to chat again sometime!

9895
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,450
Hold it!

9896
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:02,540
This is indeed unusual.

9897
00:17:02,540 --> 00:17:05,720
Slimes are normally low-ranked 
monsters that don't think,

9898
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,830
but you have self-awareness.

9899
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:09,210
Are you Unique?

9900
00:17:09,210 --> 00:17:11,200
What does "Unique" mean?

9901
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:14,030
It refers to a being with 
extraordinary abilities.

9902
00:17:14,030 --> 00:17:16,220
I'm not really sure.

9903
00:17:16,580 --> 00:17:19,840
The thing is, I used to be a human,

9904
00:17:19,840 --> 00:17:23,700
but I got stabbed and died, and next 
thing I knew, I looked like this.

9905
00:17:24,120 --> 00:17:26,440
I see. You were reincarnated.

9906
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,630
Reincarnated...

9907
00:17:28,010 --> 00:17:31,110
So I really was reborn as a slime...

9908
00:17:31,570 --> 00:17:34,860
You came into this world 
in a very unusual way.

9909
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:36,860
Huh? Unusual?

9910
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:39,970
There are occasionally those who 
come here from other worlds,

9911
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:43,070
but you are the first I've known 
of to be reincarnated here.

9912
00:17:43,070 --> 00:17:47,100
Most would be unable to withstand having 
only their soul traverse worlds.

9913
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:48,090
So you're saying

9914
00:17:48,090 --> 00:17:52,250
there are people who came here from other 
worlds, but not through reincarnation?

9915
00:17:52,250 --> 00:17:56,010
Indeed. We call them Otherworlders.

9916
00:17:56,370 --> 00:18:01,760
I've heard that they gain special abilities 
when they cross into this world.

9917
00:18:01,760 --> 00:18:05,340
I see... I guess that's 
how I got my skills, too.

9918
00:18:05,910 --> 00:18:08,440
There might even be other 
Japanese people here...

9919
00:18:08,870 --> 00:18:12,270
I think I'd like to try and find 
some of these Otherworlders.

9920
00:18:12,270 --> 00:18:15,120
What? You're leaving already?

9921
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:17,030
He's pouting!

9922
00:18:17,030 --> 00:18:20,350
U-Um... Maybe I'll stay a little longer.

9923
00:18:20,350 --> 00:18:22,280
It's not like I have anything to do...

9924
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:25,410
Oh, good! Stay as long as you like!

9925
00:18:27,470 --> 00:18:32,040
So, um, you said earlier that 
you were sealed here, right?

9926
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:34,210
I'm glad you asked that!

9927
00:18:36,370 --> 00:18:37,940
It was 300 years ago...

9928
00:18:39,870 --> 00:18:42,930
I sort of turned a town into ashes by mistake.

9929
00:18:43,310 --> 00:18:44,660
"Sort of"?

9930
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:47,930
So someone came looking to slay me.

9931
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:51,810
It's certainly true that I 
underestimated my opponent a bit.

9932
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:55,070
I started putting my full strength 
into the battle partway through...

9933
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:57,820
But I still lost!

9934
00:18:58,210 --> 00:19:00,630
But you seem really strong.

9935
00:19:00,630 --> 00:19:03,080
Was your opponent that powerful?

9936
00:19:03,080 --> 00:19:05,380
Yes, very powerful.

9937
00:19:05,930 --> 00:19:09,080
It was someone known to the humans as 
a hero blessed with divine protection.

9938
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:14,480
A human hero? Sounds like 
something out of a video game.

9939
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:18,200
She overpowered me with her unique 
skill, Absolute Severance,

9940
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:17,090
— Absolute Severance —

9941
00:19:15,420 --> 00:19:17,090
— Absolute Severance —

9942
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:22,050
and then she sealed me using 
Unlimited Imprisonment.

9943
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:23,090
Unlimited Imprisonment

9944
00:19:21,180 --> 00:19:23,090
Unlimited Imprisonment

9945
00:19:24,060 --> 00:19:26,850
Is that shiny stuff here 
Unlimited Imprisonment?

9946
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:28,240
Yes.

9947
00:19:28,620 --> 00:19:32,440
The hero called herself a "Summon."

9948
00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:32,850
Summon

