00:19:30,230 --> 00:19:32,850
Summon

9950
00:19:32,850 --> 00:19:34,490
A Summon?

9951
00:19:34,490 --> 00:19:36,860
Is that different from Otherworlders?

9952
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:41,310
It takes more than 30 mages to perform 
a ritual that lasts several days

9953
00:19:41,310 --> 00:19:43,110
to bring one here from another world.

9954
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:45,640
Oh! So there are mages here!

9955
00:19:45,640 --> 00:19:47,370
This sounds more and more like a game!

9956
00:19:47,370 --> 00:19:51,000
They're also expected to 
serve as powerful weapons.

9957
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,140
Weapons?

9958
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:54,110
Yes, for the Summoner.

9959
00:19:54,110 --> 00:19:56,940
Magic is used to carve a 
curse into the Summon's soul

9960
00:19:56,940 --> 00:19:59,630
to ensure that the Summon 
can't defy the Summoner.

9961
00:19:59,630 --> 00:20:02,630
What the heck?! That's just cruel!

9962
00:20:02,630 --> 00:20:04,200
Cruel, eh?

9963
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:06,760
I don't know what your world was like,

9964
00:20:07,230 --> 00:20:11,090
but survival of the fittest is the 
prevailing truth in this world.

9965
00:20:11,650 --> 00:20:12,910
I see...

9966
00:20:13,650 --> 00:20:17,900
So you've been in here ever 
since that hero sealed you?

9967
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:20,170
That's right.

9968
00:20:20,170 --> 00:20:22,900
I'm so very bored...

9969
00:20:22,900 --> 00:20:28,570
I felt pretty damn lonely just because 
I never had a girlfriend in 37 years...

9970
00:20:28,570 --> 00:20:31,910
I can't imagine being all alone for 300 years.

9971
00:20:32,250 --> 00:20:33,080
Okay!

9972
00:20:33,080 --> 00:20:35,580
Why don't you and I be friends?

9973
00:20:36,530 --> 00:20:42,180
What?! A mere slime proposes friendship 
with me, the feared Storm Dragon?!

9974
00:20:42,180 --> 00:20:44,340
I-If you don't want to, I understand...

9975
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:48,100
F-Fool! No one said I didn't want to!

9976
00:20:48,100 --> 00:20:51,100
Uh, really? Then... what do you say?

9977
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:54,640
Yes, well... if you insist...

9978
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:57,690
I guess I'm willing to think about it.

9979
00:20:57,690 --> 00:20:58,900
Are you some tsundere?!

9980
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:02,000
Yes, I insist! So that settles it!

9981
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:04,150
If you refuse, we're through. 
I'll never come here again!

9982
00:21:04,150 --> 00:21:08,700
W-Well, all right. I'll be your friend. 
You'd better be grateful!

9983
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:10,860
Just can't be honest,an you?

9984
00:21:10,860 --> 00:21:12,200
Well, glad to know ya!

9985
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:14,030
I-Indeed.

9986
00:21:15,810 --> 00:21:20,120
It's a little embarrassing talking 
about "friends" at my age...

9987
00:21:21,330 --> 00:21:24,840
But that's the story of 
how I got stabbed, died,

9988
00:21:24,840 --> 00:21:26,600
reincarnated as a slime,

9989
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:29,290
and became friends with 
the Storm Dragon Veldora.

9990
00:21:29,770 --> 00:21:34,380
My totally normal, 
uneventful life... is no more.

9991
00:21:34,850 --> 00:21:36,620
How could this have happened?

9992
00:21:36,620 --> 00:21:38,890
I never dreamed a life like 
this was waiting for me!

9993
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:41,480
Or should I call it a "slife"?

9994
00:21:42,290 --> 00:21:45,760
I wonder if Tamura wiped 
my hard drive for me...

9995
00:21:45,760 --> 00:21:48,740
I hope he didn't look at it first.

9996
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:56,000
* Never attempt this.

9997
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:56,000
* Never attempt this.

9998
00:21:51,990 --> 00:21:56,000
* Never attempt this.

9999
00:21:56,740 --> 00:21:59,820
Rest in peace, Senpai.

10000
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:04,390
If I ever have a son, I'll name him Satoru.

